WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.235
As news coverage has been
dominated by the chaos

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the Senate
and the White House,

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.605 size:88% position:44%
one senior official in
the Trump administration

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:06.740 line:92%
has been quietly getting away

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
with implementing
immigration policies

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:11.244
that could change
the very fabric of our society.

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.179 size:84% position:42% line:92%
This is "The Check-In."

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.615 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.449 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Ding, ding ]

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
From anonymous op-eds
to books detailing the horrors

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
of working
in the Trump administration,

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.522
we're led to believe that pretty
much everyone in the White House

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
is miserable, but that's not
the case for everyone.

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:28.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you might remember
Trump's senior policy adviser,

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:29.896 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Stephen Miller, right?

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:32.532 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.035 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:39.406 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Miller is the architect

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:40.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
of everything
from the Muslim travel ban

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.476
to separating children from
their parents at the border.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:45.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, Miller has been
avoiding TV cameras lately,

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
but when he first
got into the White House,

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
he wasn't shy
about publicly defending

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
his horrendous views
on immigration.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.754
And just watch him put the
"offensive" in charm offensive.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:58.725
-In the end, the powers of the
President of the United States

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.692 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
will be reaffirmed,

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:04.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the whole world will see
clearly and unmistakably,

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.666
and it's a message I want
the world to hear today,

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
that this country
will protect its borders.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would happen to know
better than you would, Jake,

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
about how the travel ban
was written.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.943 line:92%
And I just want to say...

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jim, that is one of the
most outrageous, insulting,

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
ignorant, and foolish things
you've ever said.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:28.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Man, imagine being that fired
up about deporting people.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:32.192
"Jim, I would fight you right
now if I weren't rock-hard

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:35.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
and forced to stand
behind this podium!"

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.831 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:43.002
But getting off on publicly
attacking illegal immigrants

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:43.803 line:92%
wasn't enough for Miller.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:46.940
He's now more quietly going
after legal immigrants, as well.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
Miller was behind
an egregious new proposal

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:51.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
that would make it more
difficult for legal immigrants

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.179 size:84% position:42%
who have used any kind
of public assistance --

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.181 size:84% position:42%
things like food stamps
or housing vouchers --

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:58.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
to get a green card or obtain
citizenship in the U.S.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
This has already resulted
in some immigrants

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
turning down government help
to buy infant formula

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
and healthy food
for their young children.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:05.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
Although, if you
listen to Fox News,

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
this whole thing
isn't Trump's fault at all.

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:09.796 size:88% position:44%
-It says that immigrants
are already turning down

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:13.366
government subsidies to help buy
staple foods and infant formula

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:17.237
for fear that it could bar them
from receiving a green card.

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:19.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that something
that's really happening?

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:20.006 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Or is that not true?

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.741
-If it's happening,
it's happening, because, again,

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:25.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
the far-left media
is misinforming
the American people.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:25.879 line:92%
They want people to panic.

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:29.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
They want the American people
to think this president

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
is racist
and he's against poor people.

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:32.085 line:92%
-The left doesn't exactly

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:35.288
have to do anything to make
Trump sound more racist.

00:02:35.288 --> 00:02:37.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Okay, guys,
he called for the execution

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.424 line:92%
of the Central Park Five,

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
he was sued for not renting
to black people,

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
he called NFL players
sons of bitches,

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:44.464
but America still thinks
he's a one-man Benetton ad,

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:48.234 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
so...any ideas?"

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.370 size:75% position:38%
But that's why Trump
gets along so well

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.204 line:92%
with people like Stephen Miller,

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:53.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they're both racist
and hate poor people,

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:56.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
especially the most vulnerable
people in the world,

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:56.609 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
like refugees.

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.411 size:84% position:42%
Just a few weeks ago,
the administration said

00:02:58.411 --> 00:02:59.979 size:81% position:41%
they would be limiting
the number of refugees

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:03.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
the United States would accept
next year to a mere 30,000,

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:04.317 size:81% position:41% line:92%
which is a record low.

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:06.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, of course,
Miller had his tentacles

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:07.921 line:92%
all over this decision, as well.

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The Trump administration
plans to slash

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:13.393 size:81% position:41%
the number of refugees
allowed into the U.S.

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:14.194 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to just 30,000...

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:17.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
at a time when the U.N. is
saying the crisis of refugees,

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:21.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
the surge in the number
of refugees around the world

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:22.202 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
is unprecedented.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:25.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is considered
a really egregious setback

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:28.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
in terms of national security
and foreign policy.

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:32.111 size:75% position:38%
-If Secretary Mattis
and Secretary Pompeo

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:33.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
aren't driving the policy,
who is?

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:36.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Stephen Miller.
He's 33 years old.

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:37.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm sorry.
-No, no.

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:39.419 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:42.989 size:75% position:38%
-No, it is hilarious
that that guy is 33.

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:44.524 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:48.161
Even his hair doesn't want
to be associated with him.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:49.162 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:53.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, whether it comes
to limiting...

00:03:53.066 --> 00:03:55.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
whether it comes to limiting
the number of refugees

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:57.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
or installing
a zero-tolerance policy

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
for immigrants
crossing the border,

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:00.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
Miller and the administration
are defending

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:02.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
these misguided policies
by claiming

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:05.345 size:88% position:44%
that they're focused on
putting Americans first.

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:06.045 size:78% position:39% line:92%
So, how's that going?

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:10.283
-Cancer research is taking a hit
because of immigration costs.

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:12.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
CNN is reporting
the Trump administration

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:14.721 size:81% position:41% line:92%
is moving $260 million

00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:19.425
from cancer research, HIV/Aids,
and other programs

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:20.393 line:92%
to cover the cost of housing

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.695
undocumented immigrant children
in custody.

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:26.633
New policies of holding kids
longer and reuniting them later

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:28.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
are one of the reasons
for the move.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:31.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, in order to pay for
detention camps for children,

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:34.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're cutting back
on cancer research.

00:04:34.007 --> 00:04:34.874 line:92%
Now, you may be asking yourself,

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:36.976
"Why couldn't they take the
money from somewhere else?"

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:39.445 size:78% position:39%
Well, it's difficult
to make that decision

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:41.080 line:92%
because President Trump just has

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
too many good ideas
that need funding.

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:47.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What are we going to do?
Space Force!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.922 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:56.462
So, how is Trump's
favorite ghoul, Stephen Miller,

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:59.198
able to get away with his
takeover of immigration policy?

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:00.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
Current and former
administration officials say

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:03.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
Miller has been blocking
opponents from key meetings,

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:04.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
restricting
the flow of information

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:06.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
and inserting his allies
in key positions.

00:05:06.806 --> 00:05:08.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Stephen just had
this aura about him.

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:11.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
People realized at that point
this guy, Stephen,

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:13.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
is the president
of immigration."

00:05:13.012 --> 00:05:16.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't think that's an aura
around Stephen Miller.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:18.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just the formaldehyde
evaporating.

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.253 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:23.222 line:92%
And things have gotten so bad

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:25.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Miller's
own childhood rabbi

00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:28.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
is now warning people about
Miller's immigration policies.

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:30.463 line:92%
-The West L.A. childhood rabbi

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:32.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
of presidential aide
Stephen Miller

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:34.267 line:92%
is blasting his former student

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:36.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
for supporting the
Trump immigration agenda.

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:40.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
Rabbi Neil Comess-Daniels
lashed out during his sermon

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:42.909 align:start size:94% position:6%
in Santa Monica
marking the Jewish new year.

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:45.278 size:84% position:42%
-There were groans when
Rabbi Comess-Daniels

00:05:45.278 --> 00:05:48.815
began his sermon reading
a letter to Stephen Miller.

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:50.683 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-To Stephen Miller...

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:51.918 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Congregation groans ]

00:05:51.918 --> 00:05:55.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
...senior advisor
to the President.

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:59.659 line:92%
It's completely untenable.

00:05:59.659 --> 00:06:02.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It is not ethical.

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:03.463 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Um, and it's cruel.

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:07.400
-To be fair, those two have
been at odds since the bris.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:10.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Rabbi, stop!
That's his head!"

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.739 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:15.174 size:84% position:42%
Even Miller's own uncle
has come out publicly

00:06:15.174 --> 00:06:17.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
to draw attention to
how hypocritical and heinous

00:06:17.543 --> 00:06:19.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
Miller's views
on immigration are.

00:06:19.278 --> 00:06:22.382
-Our family history is entirely
dependent upon the fact

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:25.752
that our family was able to
escape from a terrible situation

00:06:25.752 --> 00:06:28.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
in what is now
the country of Belarus.

00:06:28.521 --> 00:06:32.592
Put it simply, had we not
been able to enter America

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:35.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
when we did, Stephen Miller
would never exist.

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:38.264
-That's right. Stephen Miller
is a descendant of immigrants.

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:39.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not just immigrants,
but refugees.

00:06:39.599 --> 00:06:41.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
what kind of brain disease

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
causes that level
of self-hatred,

00:06:42.869 --> 00:06:44.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
but we've probably
diverted money from it

00:06:44.937 --> 00:06:47.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
to pay for detention camps
for children.

00:06:47.607 --> 00:06:49.575 line:92%
This has been "The Check-In."

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:52.645 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Ding, ding ]

